      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Of course, there are many “non-event-related groups,” such as stance groups, friend circles, and various others. However, the pressure for events to require groups creates a great deal of stress, as it forces people to leave those groups.\n\n主張のグループ、フレンドの界隈グループ、その他様々な「イベントとは無関係のグループ」は勿論多いのだが、イベントがグループ必須になる圧力によってそれらを脱退しなければならないストレスはとても高い。",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
