      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "68b2c01cab911589731829e3",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I completely agree with this.\n\nIn the past, the current number of group memberships would not have posed any issue. However, with the introduction of the excellent event calendar feature, which now allows players to check events directly within the game, I believe that the importance of joining groups has increased.\n\nWhile the number of community-based groups may not be particularly large at present, I expect that their significance will continue to grow as the group features are further developed.\n\nFor this reason, I am in favour of increasing the number of memberships.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-08-30T09:10:52.693Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, the event calendar only shows events from groups you have joined. However, even with VRC+, the limit is only 200 groups, so if you want to join many events, you’ll quickly hit that cap. This is especially true if you are also in groups that don’t host events, such as communities or groups meant to represent a stance.\n\nThe importance of groups has increased dramatically due to the event calendar (it can provide a reason for events that were not previously hosted by groups to move into groups).\n\nIf the group join limit is not increased, it will no longer reflect the actual situation.\n\n現在、イベントカレンダーには参加しているグループのイベントしか表示されません。しかし、VRC+であっても上限は200グループに過ぎず、多くのイベントに参加したい場合はすぐに制限に達してしまいます。特に、イベントを開催しないコミュニティや主張を表すグループに所属している場合はなおさらです。\n\nイベントカレンダーによってグループの重要度は飛躍的に増しており（これまでグループで開催されていなかったイベントがグループに移行する理由となり得ます）、グループ加入数の上限を増やさなければ、実情にそぐわなくなると思います。",
